# Git Workflow Safety

- Start new code changes on a new branch, not directly on `main`.
- Before committing, run the project's relevant tests and make sure they pass.
- If tests fail, fix failures before commit.

## Quick Examples

```bash
# Create and switch to a new branch
git checkout -b feature/short-description

# Run tests before commit/push
npm test
```
